OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy start
OL,6,Fwith occasional light rain, then
OL,7,Fbecoming drier with some clear spells
OL,8,Fthis evening. Overnight stays dry in
OL,9,Feast, but cloudier in west with a few
OL,10,Fshowers. Rather cold.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FBright or sunny spells with
OL,13,Fthe odd shower possible at first in
OL,14,Fthe west. Becoming drier through the
OL,15,Fmorning to leave a dry afternoon with
OL,16,Fsunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
